Package: Seurat2Phantasus
Title: Generate Pseudobulk Expression Profiles for Phantasus
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Sangbum", "Park", email = "spark@msu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Artem", "Kiselev", role = "aut"))
Description: Aggregate single-cell expression values by biological sample and
    cell cluster. Return a Bioconductor ExpressionSet or export a GCT file
    for downstream analysis in Phantasus.
